{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:20e177266af33892a9f882ad7275c0321f86e4b4dfb248a00acc019019a707eb",
      "text": "Shut up!!!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ead53c24b5aa42737e649ef71c166fc005ab72b149310c22b4ec0b6dc528e18",
      "text": "You two are the ones who hate being\ncalled upstarts, not me! Stop\nforcing it on me!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b075a09c79626f7e4a4126ad5e4bae1e0a778810ee8b8f56e09b8148fa2ec581",
      "text": "I want more freedom...! I want to\ntry doing things my own way!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "16": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9b2320ba3f14b98fe963ef5ab060b52c65dfe7a9dbcba4920c994505f42dab0",
      "text": "And after being free, then what?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57d1a69d2cf1412af945e9bb61d9b8a6236ac35ad4852c2ebf94850a295ef35c",
      "text": "I don't have anything I'd push\npeople aside to get.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f044ec649f3c10e399d441175cf83ffc42e40f8d7aa02e542d3733b5c863b4fe",
      "text": "...Ugh, that's why!!! I want to\nfind it—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cde6b13f38e44575c7e1da1d35cd21a118c8e33d8dd3bf8ba73696d51041b267",
      "text": "In this world that has changed?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:112db7bec27b2280909da5876f32f52e2855a82b9fcea84fd66906dd9c0f31ac",
      "text": "Ah... Aaaah... ...Whoa... I fell\nasleep...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9d483703e18054c097a8393fc4a37acd14fe9854cd66a1d33fda4fd91aa48e3b",
      "text": "That dream... First time since\nMagia Fest? I haven't had it in\nages...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d44d2eea4bf341e8a09525f5b6e505a644a6991d627ff1016796b1571a3fbad7",
      "text": "...I'm fine. Yeah.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f4161f3aabc9896f28dabe0013ab28e5d50dfae8f95b6a629a5b56997cbba2b",
      "text": "...Okay! Let's get totally hyped!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4d6666832b3fe337a9aa5086d7d1c0f94249178cec31a996512ddf3f4e047544",
      "text": "Wait, seriously?! You have\nmanga-like things here too?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:456c3d72a80fbb8d1b3f88b31402026809e616b9d4f7126b1fae9e550dc1b9bb",
      "text": "Hey, show me sometime! I wasn't\nallowed stuff like that as a kid,\nso I'm reading tons now!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b94cdac95038d6e9d761033dfc9ff434442f9b2c7308042149d2f5236d8e5392",
      "text": "Hmph. Yae really does make friends\nwith all kinds of people so\nquickly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:70c56037579505f54c64cea12a966739ea9f111db2ad13ff1dcabeb74bf36995",
      "text": "Well... That's... Heh, a real\nheartbreaker, that one.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:64f037d60744f6c5f9db7aa2f1b7a97f51b246e4e9ed092dcb7c07c45427ac7c",
      "text": "Asato. Got a minute? I think I saw\none of the people who was with you\nthe other day.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ada8927d6478883d164f5ae5d925f3e5612c534dba9dbbb00ab4c2cb3628e05",
      "text": "Seriously?! You mean Haruto, right?\nLike, a crime?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f235ac9f5d0cb9d375d612138a8a39326b882d9ae5908c568b866d623714b2c",
      "text": "I didn't say that. I just saw him\nhanging around with a pretty shady\ncrowd, so I figured I'd tell you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d3714bd5d78c2114d8a5d1e5ed768be4de3c6067850dc8951c1164594c66c197",
      "text": "...A friend of yours?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "74": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:074e276b1ef49da2b1a034ba70c54f77732fef3c0d25236b933add7e47e617c9",
      "text": "Yeah... He's my friend's boyfriend,\nand we've all hung out a few\ntimes...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c9e0ed3475677d8b1941f00c6e5b1be4ed82e3d3a985467477d3fb4cc520eccd",
      "text": "Haruto was in Aegis before, sure,\nbut why would he do this even after\ncoming here...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:77fc0b756600698e1e378a6d42574e06a2f161ea2d769e639fbd355ad4a9da59",
      "text": "...Sorry. I'm going to go find\nHaruto and talk to him!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bc8c39dbf820a24440634fe64425cb5d7d61716bcc7aca1838fba1f9e3fd1668",
      "text": "Wait. Even you don't know the\npeople hanging around in Palpebra's\nback alleys.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a225a7901533d621c4d0af0cd3e7595e32042912a3c46537b0d3236a61a3e552",
      "text": "We have connections. We've been in\nPalpebra a long time, after all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3b7127af4acd96d0158a2f9ff4096b2e00bf9356832271fb2f2a56b5b3432fa2",
      "text": "Thank you...! Please help me look!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e60daf9ce4d04a5b867dd48b0bf2ea0f1fdd9a91aeb9311fa57161a24b08f08b",
      "text": "It's not complicated. Just take\nthis package, stand in that alley,\nand hand it to a buddy passing by.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62336b299a7e3670f1ed3aaeb804f575f8b0bd17cf0bc70f8cddeaab8834e657",
      "text": "...I know, I know.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:78962d560e3c64b7f7fb7cf0ff0ae9c71d99d4f12500b2ba3445c9c69f11f2dd",
      "text": "Hold it right there!!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6b47428829bcc02ac626380e2370864b7364fb7c88356e5cfec5cc6d9b1648a",
      "text": "...Wow, it really is Haruto...!\nWhat are you doing?! These guys are\ncriminals!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "112": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:40bd322f95f5198aeea890ea7c97ddd26dae683fbf81faf4a6900f4042b00db8",
      "text": "...Whatever. I'll hear about it\nlater. C'mon, let's go—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1d851612fb62ac37631291341e5e5616e1f87c27327044e427c2a7cc4e2e724",
      "text": "...It's got nothing to do with you.\nStop butting in.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2ad202fb04b0223dc09bb92c4f1c08498fc73489772f44a2e46c12c2df1aafd3",
      "text": "Wh-what are you talking about? This\nis totally bad news!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a24100c8a510a0c9d2220b201b7ef22588b39508ef0a8cb20daa61c32d181f78",
      "text": "That's why I'm doing it! There's no\nway anyone makes it in a world like\nthis...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b4a2caabdb51547d68495959c381b664066655327f7725d798f67752cd585a86",
      "text": "...Well, someone as carefree as you\nwouldn't get it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8e667f95d306f8329efb47d910687f8c0251eacace0f038ba44d0aadced9e31c",
      "text": "Hey, say it like you always do.\n\"Oh, that sounds great!\" to\neverything, with that stupid grin!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:260dd8126b6d8c1933abc08d61aabea9a6d177f2e176a43d5f2aba6e72ae2df7",
      "text": "...Huh? ...What's that supposed to\nmean?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "135": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8753f6b122c24ac24edb7b69040794b8dabd324d860a3e4ea5f47f0e33808357",
      "text": "...I don't know what you think, but\nI only say what I actually think is\ngood.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ee024316e814df9dcd0c4fac58de8b8a79474a081a5f1ebf0040f3ee7f166a0",
      "text": "Also? Quit looking down on people.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6f395d0985a83f8b7d7de5e290512e0881d87f4db2a79e2bcdc4bf1c993e7394",
      "text": "Don't use me as an excuse for\nrunning away from reality because\nyou're scared!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:43b5bb7437f0c941294a54ca81118b2a07440ba11dfe0793e61c15870c86fe61",
      "text": "—Asato!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fe8c914de600be89b97dfaf390ebe1902667ac6e56613c13e3d38677cb61538c",
      "text": "Hey, don't let it get to you. There\nwas no helping that guy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:107e83890709a2f97fa719fa973c6ec68eca1258812defc2c588527fc5be39b4",
      "text": "...Yeah. But... I get anxious\nsometimes too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:40da1cf148fa618ffa0988050a0b1d478257444d36010f52e217003cc0da0fd5",
      "text": "...Magia Fest gave me energy, but\nI'm only human. I can't stay like\nthat forever.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9845a00267834e0bc684f81b39a4a019b7075ee8c1aa2477da39b871b5a917d3",
      "text": "Hyped up, then down. Over and over,\nand it's exhausting...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:024c4699fdaf2458f87a27b0c723a4773a76baacde3451944a1521f5433c13b1",
      "text": "...I kind of get why he'd want to\nrun away.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:70113f0a89a00e0c131eb45ae660c90a72887e90818d155d8925f1f56e4df3bc",
      "text": "Huh? Ayumu. What are you doing\nhere?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f240ce222209e5633f65c52d42a8081c4872fc068c518886fbfc68b013fe56d",
      "text": "Oh, this and that. What about you,\nSho? A job?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "176": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:73c4aa4348e842fca6be718d540d115a418b3c96840b3e208ddad5018eb06ec7",
      "text": "Yeah. You know that shop I went to\nwith Asato? I'm guarding one of the\nstaff.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ee04c3b79c7f256f01bb1414ecfe4a73cc8e6525a18c70eb1d03a5090b497c59",
      "text": "Ta-da! My first time in Palpebra! I\nbought so much stuff!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6297df22586547d23f140dda9fc3320d9897a4ce062d27f7c8b03fb45d861049",
      "text": "She even pitched her shop while out\nshopping. Some stores might do\nbusiness with her. Wild, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2ab15aad2304b1d2ef6cc5dd11f2025ffb0ce9642779f64e61d14ff54d131436",
      "text": "I was super nervous and scared,\nthough! But I couldn't lose to Yae!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5922c96a985207c4f14246843aa95954c9ec4c29270aba2bec265d898dad989e",
      "text": "...!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a31ce993ea7833ea4c5a567d92c12f09318bd85d6874a84c18df6fe3762fee4b",
      "text": "Probably, no, almost definitely, a\nlot of people are moving forward\nbecause they've seen you, Asato.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f321f853eac55b1a879a92aa89846828a5e637e382a3a8493493e25cfe43b130",
      "text": "Uu... Uuuuuuuuh...!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:db023d9bfb1b0a90d93c4cf516d88762a94304bc6c957222340c598aa7030b53",
      "text": "Huh?! What? Why are you crying all\nof a sudden?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7373501db614e5d8cde6afcc765b9fe576e805da4bdc4fdf212b70e2256c46a9",
      "text": "Becauuuuse... Beeecauuuuse...!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "213": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ab57a4d01678934e0f8fa3506f15046e508094c88918ff86647f9f9590337898",
      "text": "Ah... This dream again...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9b2320ba3f14b98fe963ef5ab060b52c65dfe7a9dbcba4920c994505f42dab0",
      "text": "And after being free, then what?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "218": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57d1a69d2cf1412af945e9bb61d9b8a6236ac35ad4852c2ebf94850a295ef35c",
      "text": "I don't have anything I'd push\npeople aside to get.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:521052e548eb24a3715454ed125202356c99b1c1b423b916520c8d3b2287c3f2",
      "text": "...Yeah. That's why I want to find\nit.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:99e24a7d0dd81a9ae8bd0b78b968378891837362f8faba9fd546adb5e07b67f5",
      "text": "By talking to all kinds of people,\nseeing all kinds of worlds. I want\nto find my very own sparkle.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "228": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ef9ccd32fe672dccac6053ecffd223a50f5cf321c315b30ea52abf28173ed0e1",
      "text": "In this world that has changed?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "232": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9e8cdec95c45a68075ce7f8e38ba53d16527a6910135205954dfa5e3098d8d1a",
      "text": "Well, duh!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "236": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:94a12e394fef388aaba7f7f54c00fac5f28b1111e7256af075f7ad6bf28f76cf",
      "text": "In this world, I'll fly anywhere\nand everywhere—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
